note Contract section 4 line 89: a write to i anywhere in the unrolled body is error 7, here inside a
note rolled loop nested in it (line 10, the i = add i 1).
om2
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4 unroll
for j ulong 2
s = add s j
i = add i 1
end
end
ret int s
end
